# 16. Detailed sprint plan

## Sprint 0 — Alignment and access

Duration: 2–3 days

```
- confirm first workflow
- confirm reviewer
- collect sample invoices
- collect relevant manual pages
- identify invoice source folder
- define safety boundaries
- list credentials
```

Output:

```
- workflow brief
- sample data set
- access checklist
```

---

## Sprint 1 — Invoice extraction MVP

Duration: 1 week

```
- read invoice PDFs from folder
- extract invoice fields
- create invoice table
- show extracted values
- allow human correction
```

Output:

```
- invoice extraction prototype
- extraction accuracy report
```

---

## Sprint 2 — Rule checks and exception flags

Duration: 1 week

```
- duplicate invoice check
- missing field check
- tax check
- due date check
- unknown vendor check
- status assignment
```

Output:

```
- invoice verification MVP
- exception list
- reviewer view
```

---

## Sprint 3 — Vendor / contract matching

Duration: 1–2 weeks

```
- create vendor master
- create contract master
- match invoice to vendor
- match invoice to contract/project
- flag amount mismatch
- flag contract missing
```

Output:

```
- vendor/contract matching engine
- blocked/needs-review logic
```

---

## Sprint 4 — Approval and audit

Duration: 1 week

```
- approval states
- reviewer comments
- Slack/Teams notification
- audit log
- escalation rules
```

Output:

```
- approval workflow
- auditable decision trail
```

---

## Sprint 5 — Money Forward preparation

Duration: 1–2 weeks

```
- research Money Forward API
- define data mapping
- prepare Money Forward-ready records
- prepare evidence file package
- sync status manually or via API if available
```

Output:

```
- Money Forward integration plan
- upload-ready data
- safe preparation workflow
```

---

## Sprint 6 — Reminders and expense claims

Duration: 2 weeks

```
- invoice submission reminders
- expense submission reminders
- expense receipt OCR
- expense rule check
- approval routing
```

Output:

```
- reminder workflow
- expense confirmation workflow
```

---

## Sprint 7 — Outbound invoice support

Duration: 2–3 weeks

```
- expected invoice tracker
- contract-to-invoice check
- unpaid invoice tracker
- payment receipt check
```

Output:

```
- outbound invoice dashboard
- cash collection support
```

