# 17. Priority matrix

| Priority | Workflow | Start timing | Why |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | Invoice verification from outsourced service provider | Now | High accounting value, safe in analysis-only mode |
| 2 | Invoice/expense submission notifications | After MVP | Low risk, visible quick win |
| 3 | Expense reimbursement confirmation | After reminders | Rule-based and valuable |
| 4 | Accounting data rule checker | After invoice checks | Good assistant for reviewers |
| 5 | Outbound invoice issuing | Phase 2 | Important but client-facing |
| 6 | Attendance closing | Phase 2/3 | Useful but partly HR |
| 7 | Contract handling | Phase 2/3 | Needs legal/approval clarity |
| 8 | Bank accounting management | Later | Important but risky |
| 9 | Foreign currency procedures | Later | High compliance risk |
| 10 | Tax payments | Much later | High compliance risk |
| 11 | Bank payments | Much later | High financial risk |
| 12 | Financial closing | Later | Best after transaction flows are stable |

